DP: dp[i] = True if s[:i] can be segmented. For each i, try all word lengths.

```python
def word_break(s, word_dict):
    n = len(s)
    dp = [False] * (n + 1)
    dp[0] = True
    for i in range(1, n + 1):
        for w in word_dict:
            if dp[i - len(w)] and s[i - len(w):i] == w:
                dp[i] = True
                break
    return dp[n]
```

